        "Content": "\nDNG Tipperary Town present for sale this derelict bungalow residence standing on circa 0.28 hectares (0.69 Acres) at Garrynalyna, Galbally, Co. Limerick \n\nHeld in Folio LK25530\n\nFor Sale Via our online Auction Platform and the date for this Online Auction will be published at a later date\n\nLocated walking distance of Galbally village this project offers a unique oppertunity for first time buyers and owner occupiers to create their dream home in a tranquil rural setting, with significant financial support avaible through grants\n\nEligible buyers may benfit from the Croi Conaithe fund, which offers grants of up to 70,000 for the refurbishment of derlict homes. Additionally the property may qualify for the sustainable Eneergy Authority of Irleands Better Energy Home Scheme potentially providing a further 26,750 to enhance the homes energy efficency\n\nThis property offers hassle free development oppertunity, as it allows for planning permission without the usual 'local needs' restrictions\n\nFurther particulars from selling agent Paul Cranley 06231986"
